:"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y219","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o048","basis":"建安二十四年秋"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-o055a-q","xianzhu-q-o048","xianzhu-q-b-c3e56caa3865de7f7114"]},"source_order":[32,211,"O055a"],"related_events":[{"event":"huangli-e2-huangquan-zhizhong","type":"related","evidence":["huangli-q2-0a4da79e2745b2da2b6c","xianzhu-e-o055a-q"]},{"event":"dengzhang-e2-three-ministers","type":"related","evidence":["dengzhang-q2-0eabec327d7f8184a731","xianzhu-e-o055a-q"]}],"order":6581}],"persons":[{"id":"xianzhu-p0076","name":"赖恭","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0104","name":"黄柱","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0105","name":"王谋","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dengzhang-q-e2717e677ec9a520b8cc","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-96d3f55961b19f0ab838","layer":"original","quote":"先主为汉中王，用荆楚宿士零陵赖恭为太常〖67〗，南阳黄柱为光禄勋，谋为少府","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":179,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":53,"end":90},{"id":"dengzhang-q2-0eabec327d7f8184a731","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-96d3f55961b19f0ab838","layer":"original","quote":"王元泰名谋，汉嘉人也。有容止操行〖66〗。刘璋时，为巴郡太守。还为州治中从事。先主定益州，领牧，以为别驾。先主为汉中王，用荆楚宿士零陵赖恭为太常〖67〗，南阳黄柱为光禄勋，谋为少府。建兴初，赐爵关内侯。后代赖恭为太常。恭、柱、谋皆失其行事，故不为传。恭子厷，为丞相西曹令史〖68〗。随诸葛亮于汉中，早夭。亮甚惜之，与留府长史、参军张裔、蒋琬书曰：“令史失赖厷，掾属丧杨颙，为朝中损益多矣〖69〗！”颙亦荆州人也。后大将军蒋琬问张休曰：“汉嘉前辈有王元泰，今谁继者？”休对曰：“至于元泰，州里无继〖70〗；况鄙郡乎？”其见重如此。﹝一﹞","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":179,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":267},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o055a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-430cf056e3d7a4efdfc3","layer":"original","quote":"遂于沔阳设坛场〖60〗，陈兵列众，群臣陪位；读奏讫，御王冠于先主。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":33}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
